{
  "id": "spec-voltage-divider",
  "summary": "12 V 经 30 kΩ / 10 kΩ 分压，给 ADC 一个 3 V 的输入",
  "interfaces": [
    {"name": "VIN", "kind": "power_in", "v_nom": 12.0},
    {"name": "MID", "kind": "signal_out"}
  ],
  "acceptance": [
    {
      "id": "A1",
      "text": "分压点电压 3.0 V（容差 ±1 %）",
      "testbench": {"type": "op"},
      "measure": {"kind": "value_at", "signal": "V(MID)"},
      "pass": {"op": "between", "low": 2.97, "high": 3.03, "unit": "V"}
    },
    {
      "id": "A2",
      "text": "从电源取的电流 0.3 mA（容差 ±5 %）",
      "testbench": {"type": "op"},
      "measure": {"kind": "value_at", "signal": "I(VIN)"},
      "pass": {"op": "between", "low": 0.000285, "high": 0.000315, "unit": "A"}
    }
  ],
  "assumptions": [
    "手算：V(MID) = 12 V × R2 / (R1 + R2) = 12 × 10 k / 40 k = 3.000 V；电流 = 12 V / (R1 + R2) = 12 / 40 k = 0.300 mA",
    "仿真里的电阻是理想阻值，所以计算值和仿真值应当几乎完全相等；容差留给元件值的舍入"
  ]
}
